From 1d40f24b3c891e67a5351b9a64f48b1ca098b73a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:11:18 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 033/119] arm64: dts: exynos: gtactive3wifi: Add PMIC, charger
 and battery nodes

Describe the power devices from the stock DTBO (hw_rev 4):

- S2MPS18 under ACPM (fragment@71, acpm-ipc-channel 2) with the 13 bucks
  and 32 LDOs the stock kernel uses, names and always-on/boot-on flags
  from the stock regulators node. The driver is read-only for now, so no
  voltage constraints are given; the stock ranges are kept as comments.
- MAX77705 PMIC (0x66), charger (0x69) and fuel gauge (0x36) on HSI2C_40
  (fragment@30). IRQ on gpa1-6, active low. The stock fuel gauge uses
  fg_resistor = 2, i.e. a 5 mOhm sense resistor.
- The EB-BT575BBE battery: 5000 mAh, 4.26 V float voltage, 3.1 A max
  charge current, 3.2 V empty (stock sec-battery node).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../dts/exynos/exynos9810-gtactive3wifi.dts   | 329 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 329 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9810-gtactive3wifi.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9810-gtactive3wifi.dts
index edbbecdea..a0e9d9cf3 100644
