+/*
+ * S2MPS18 main PMIC, reached through ACPM IPC channel 2 (stock
+ * s2mps18mfd node, DTBO hw_rev 4). The driver is read-only for now, so
+ * the regulators carry no voltage constraints: the stock ranges are
+ * kept as comments for when voltage control is enabled. The PMIC IRQ is
+ * gpa0-1 (not used yet).
+ */
